    "name": "univ-v2 — scoped-tenant-v2",
    "description": "Subset of univ-v2: holiday and notice APIs using utility/scoped.js tenant context.\n\nImport alongside univ-v2 or use variables: baseurl, token, institute_id, acedmicYear_id.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "holiday",
      "description": "Institute holidays under /holiday.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer {{token}} — any role.\n\n**GET /** returns all holidays for current institute + academic year (flat array). No role filter.\n\n**Tenant scope (utility/scoped.js):** Active login context from PUT /user/saveUserDefaults + optional x-institute-id header. Query/body acedmicYearId, instituteId, universityId are optional (FE compat) and ignored in business logic.\n\n**Validation:** Zod on all routes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "create",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Republic Day\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-01-26\",\n  \"event\": \"National holiday\",\n  \"remark\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/holiday",
              "host": [
                "{{baseurl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "holiday"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**POST /holiday**\n\nOptional: name, date, event, remark. Tenant IDs injected on create via scoped()."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "list (all)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/holiday?acedmicYearId={{acedmicYear_id}}&instituteId={{institute_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseurl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "holiday"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "acedmicYearId",
                  "value": "{{acedmicYear_id}}",
                  "description": "Optional — ignored; uses login academic year"
                },
                {
                  "key": "instituteId",
                  "value": "{{institute_id}}",
                  "description": "Optional — ignored; uses login institute"
                },
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "event",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**GET /holiday**\n\nReturns all holidays for active institute + academic year. Any role.\n\n**200:** flat JSON array ordered by date DESC.\n\nOptional filters: name, event, date (still scoped)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
